 at Farnworth. JF tells of discrimination against Irish and Catholics.	Interviewee's home	1	Farnworth	5	08.03.1970; 10.03.1970; 17.03.1970	Anne Burke	 	C707/131/1-2	1	1	54	2000int131	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	2	Open reel	1	2	1	1
