d stories. Birthdays and Christmas celebrated.	Interviewee's home	2	Bolton	5	10.09.1970; 22.08.1970; 26.08.1970	Anne Burke	 	C707/136/1-3	1	1	92	2000int136	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	3	Open reel	1	2	1	1
