w vegetables. Mother paid for AH's college education from savings. Detail: family food; upbringing; religion and religious practices; country holidays; family prayers; class; social division; schooling.	Interviewee's home	2	Stoke-on-Trent	8	17.02.1971; 24.02.1971; 03.03.1971	Carroll Hill	 	C707/196/1-2	1	1	49	2000int196	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	2	Open reel	1	2	1	1
