. Family had a cat. Bachelor farmer, employer bought REW a suit. Father had insurance through quarry trade union. Brother's daughter married Professor Glyn L. Philips. Detail of quarry work; farming.	Interviewee's home	1	Llan Ffestiniog	10	~	Lucia Jones	 	C707/201/1-2	1	1	68	2000int201	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	2	Open reel	1	2	1	1
