gest sister died when five days old. HBD had diphtheria and rheumatic fever aged seven years.	Father started first orchestra in Blaenau. Children helped in the home. Children were punished with birch by father. Father made and carved the Chair for Corwyn Eisteddfod. HBD wanted to be able to carve in wood. Detail: children's pranks and games; Chapel activities; Sayat; Blaenau community; school; sibling careers.	Interviewee's home	1	Blaenau Ffestiniog	10	~	Lucia Jones	 	C707/209/1-4	1	1	47	2000int209	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	4	Open reel	1	2	1	1
