ed himself a ragamuffin; taught to be respective and well-mannered.	Interviewee's home	3	London	3	15.04.1971	~	 	C707/214/1-3	1	1	58	2000int214	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	3	Open reel	1	2	1	1
