 to collect horse manure for the garden. Father paid into sick club. Detail: climate; grass hoppers; children's games; local community; hosiery factory work; R.H. Swain.	Interviewee's home	2	Nottingham	1	14.06.1971; 21.06.1971	Jean Jacobs	 	C707/222/1-2	1	1	63	2000int222	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	2	Open reel	1	2	1	1
