ther baked bread. Parents grew vegetables. Parents had many friends. Went to cinema, concerts, and eisteddfods in Blaenau with friends. Belonged to drama group. Later joined Women's Institute. Sir Lewis Casson and Dame Sibyl Thorndyke came to tea with GMJ and husband. Paid into insurance	Interviewee's home	1	Llan Ffestiniog	10	~	Lucia Jones	 	C707/238/1-2	1	1	53	2000int238	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/notranscript.asp	http://www.esds.ac.uk/qualidata/online/explore/nomaterial.asp	2	Open reel	1	2	1	1
